Subject: [PATCH 2912/3799] soh: rename func_80B3F0DC -> EnXc_NextAfterAction42

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 42 to 43
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index c6a12ae62..6cba1ae57 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1353,7 +1353,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterAction41(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_41, SHEIK_ACTION_42);
 }
 
-void func_80B3F0DC(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B3F0DC: the same guard from action 42 to 43
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction42(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_42, SHEIK_ACTION_43);
 }
 
@@ -1432,7 +1433,7 @@ void EnXc_ActionFunc41(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc42(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ThrowNut(this, play);
-    func_80B3F0DC(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction42(this);  // was func_80B3F0DC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc43(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
